[h1]SaucedCarts v2.1.13[/h1]
[i]Released: 2026-07-28[/i]

[b]You can now open doors with E while pushing a cart.[/b]

[h1]What's New[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Open and close doors with E while pushing a cart.[/b] The interact key used to be switched off entirely while pushing — you had to stop and right-click every door. Now E works on doors (double doors, garage doors, player-built doors included) exactly like it does empty-handed. Everything else E can do stays blocked while pushing: no climbing fences or walls, no hopping through windows, no sheet ropes, no crawling into bed with a shopping cart in hand — you'll get a quick "I can't do that while pushing this cart" instead. Works the same on controller.
[/list]

[h1]Compatibility[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Save-safe.[/b] No save-data changes — safe to upgrade mid-save. Existing carts and saves are unaffected.
[*][b]Addon authors:[/b] the cart-registration API is unchanged.
[/list]
